{"id":"n28328-1-7","stage":3,"title":"눈뜨다 · 醒","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28328-1-7-1","ko":"내일은 아침 일찍 눈떠서 집을 나서야 해.","zh":"明天我得早起出门呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일은","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일은","audio":"/audio/a7181639ea1108daa648.mp3"}},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"눈떠서","meaning":"醒，睁开眼睛","explanation":"눈뜨다：醒，睁开眼睛；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"눈뜨다","audio":"/audio/5b647e3b0c36c3e4c151.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28328","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈떠서","audio":"/audio/cfe916328e91204505dd.mp3"}},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집을","audio":"/audio/cd6aaeb8eea1e3b476ad.mp3"}},{"text":"나서야","meaning":"走出，出发","explanation":"나서다：走出，出发；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"나서다","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61183","senseId":"4","lemma":"나서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서야","audio":"/audio/a29e68d399ceaacc6324.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"5b647e3b0c36c3e4","term":"눈뜨다","zh":"醒，睁开眼睛","audio":"/audio/5b647e3b0c36c3e4c151.mp3","entryId":"28328","definition":"睡觉醒来。","pronunciation":["눈뜨다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"d8c0446b0a9a131b","term":"나서다","zh":"走出，出发","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3","entryId":"61183","definition":"为去某处而从身在地方出来或离开。","pronunciation":["나서다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a86478f374aa5013f46c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28328-1-7-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 오늘 일찍 자야겠네요.","zh":"是吗？那今天得早点睡觉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"자야겠네요.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자야겠네요","audio":"/audio/bbfa70bc35995786ffbf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8254298168bcce6ab64f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28328","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.5017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那今天得早点睡觉了。","明天我得早起出门呢。","作为父亲生日的礼物，选什么好呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["明天我得早起出门呢。","作为父亲生日的礼物，选什么好呢？","是吗？那今天得早点睡觉了。"],"answer":2}]}
